files inside have individual `+i` protections.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. COMPARATIVE ANALYSIS: OPTION A vs. OPTION B\\n\\n| Dimension | Option A: Ownership `root:root` + Mode `755` | Option B: Directory-level `chattr +i` |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Mechanism** | Sta\n<truncated 5648 bytes>","Description":"\"Update 02-parent-directory-lock.md with ext4 parent permission correction and explicit ordering\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/DRAFTS/02-parent-directory-lock.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating 02-parent-directory-lock.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Sync 02-parent-directory-lock\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
